s the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":211750,"global_rank":274480},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":211744,"global_rank":274494},{"name":"gordonwatts/ami-helper","owner":"gordonwatts","html_url":"https://github.com/gordonwatts/ami-helper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":16,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274508},{"name":"RussNavas/PythonAgent","owner":"RussNavas","html_url":"https://github.com/RussNavas/PythonAgent","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A toy LLM agent based on a Boot.dev project","topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274527},{"name":"hucker/pathlib2","owner":"hucker","html_url":"https://github.com/hucker/pathlib2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Prototype implimentation of extensions to pathlib library for python.","topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274530},{"name":"thethirddan/olen","owner":"thethirddan","html_url":"https://github.com/thethirddan/olen","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274536},{"name":"weikaih04/MoGe2_3D_foundation","owner":"weikaih04","html_url":"https://github.com/weikaih04/MoGe2_3D_foundation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274537},{"name":"aksdad/bookbot","owner":"aksdad","html_url":"https://github.com/aksdad/bookbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211739,"global_rank":274542},{"name":"teeratornk/ag2_agent_stock_plot","owner":"teeratornk","html_url":"h